    {
      "flavor_text": "たいようの　ひかりを　あびて\nぜんしんで　こうごうせいを　する。\nこうらは　つちが　かたくなったもの。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "태양의 빛을 쬐어\n전신으로 광합성을 한다.\n등껍질은 흙이 딱딱해진 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps assimile la lumière du soleil par\nphotosynthèse. Sa carapace est faite de terre durcie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Sonnenlicht betreibt sein ganzer Körper\nPhotosynthese. Sein Panzer besteht aus hartem Lehm.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza la fotosíntesis al bañarle los rayos de sol.\nSu concha está formada por tierra endurecida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fa la fotosintesi su tutto il corpo esponendosi ai\nraggi solari. La sua corazza è fatta di terra compatta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Photosynthesis occurs across its body under the\nsun. The shell on its back is actually hardened soil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "太陽の　光を　浴びて\n全身で　光合成を　する。\n甲羅は　土が　硬くなったもの。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza la fotosíntesis al bañarle los rayos de sol.\nSu concha está formada por tierra endurecida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんで　こうごうせいを　して\nさんそを　つくる。のどが　かわくと\nあたまの　はっぱが　しおれてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전신으로 광합성을 하여\n산소를 만든다. 목이 마르면\n머리의 잎사귀가 시들어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps produit de l’oxygène par photosynthèse.\nLa feuille sur sa tête flétrit quand il a soif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Körper lebt von der Photosynthese,\ndie Sauerstoff freisetzt. Ist es durstig, welkt sein Blatt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza la fotosíntesis para obtener oxígeno. Si tiene\nsed, las hojas de la cabeza se marchitan.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
